usage: sol do files.delete --paths <string>... [--json] [--dry-run] [--person ID]

Delete files or folders from all devices.

Arguments:
  --paths  list of string  required; repeat the flag or give a comma list

Effect:   destructive (removes data; --dry-run shows what it would do)
Approval: agents (an agent's call waits for your approval in sol inbox)
